  </table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><b>Proposal 3. Ratify Wolf &amp; Company, P.C. as
Independent Registered Public Accountant - </b>The Company&#8217;s stockholders ratified the appointment of Wolf &amp; Company, P.C. as
the Company&#8217;s independent registered public accounting firm for the fiscal year ending December 31, 2023, by the following vote:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

